@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+The order-triage factory receives canonical instruction content through its loader argument. The runtime must resolve `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` and pass that content to `createOrderTriageAgent`.
+
+The resulting agent classifies orders for human review. It does not approve refunds or perform the refund decision.
